{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S11—S13的因果解释和最终生活落点不如X完整，且S11、S12短停留段的感受提示切换较密。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的主句更短，重点词直接凸显，感受提示又缩小并随乐段出现，普通观众更容易先抓住每段主线，再在音乐对应处补到细节。它的听觉描写明显更细腻、具体，情绪变化也更有层次；不过X的因果解释更充分，尤其结尾关于即使没有新的亲近关系也要继续好好生活的收束更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2826062-1363-42ec-9bc4-784d0e073139", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090922985094Z", "elapsed_seconds": 230.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:13:13.620364+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67950f98d8a0ff8db03d996330049b77b818854ed38dd57e30511ad79ec1f3b9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a